jab tak ke gham-e-karbobala baqi hai<br>
har dard ki yeh dost dawa baqi hai<br>
arif hai agar naf-se-quda ka tu samajh<br>
shabbir hai baqi toh quda baqi hai<br>
ya hussain ya hussain ya hussain ya mazloom<br>
<br>
1. tu hi faq-re- ambiya hai tu nabi ke dil ka chain<br>
tu ali ka ladla hai fatima ka noor-e-ain<br>
arsh-e-qaliq se sada aayi ke hai mera hussain<br>
<br>
2. jab kiya inkar sajde ka toh rab ne yeh kaha<br>
sajda-e-adam nahi ab yeh hain noor-e-mustafa<br>
do jahan karte hain tere azm ko sajda hussain<br>
<br>
3. tu ne rahe haq mein akbar sa jawan beta diya<br>
aur ali asghar ko tune dasht mein dafna diya<br>
ghar lutaya deen ki khatir aur diya fidiya hussain<br>
<br>
4. saare alam mein kisi ne kaam na aisa kiya<br>
darmiya laashon ke tune shukr ka sajda kiya<br>
kaba kehta hai ke hain yeh manfareed sajda hussain<br>
<br>
5. lasha-e-abbas par pahunche hussain ibne ali<br>
aur kaha bhai pukaro yeh tamanna hai meri<br>
isliye abbas ne rokar kaha bhaiya hussain<br>
<br>
6. abid-e-muztar ko zalim ne pinayi bediya<br>
dekh te hi rehgayi manzar yeh saari bibiya<br>
har khadam lab par yahi hai aye mere baba hussain<br>
<br>
7. jab sakina shaam ke zindaan me roti rehgayi<br>
zalimon ke zulm se ghut ghut ke bachi margayi<br>
kampte haathon se tha abid ne dafnaya hussain<br>
<br>
8. sar khule jab shaam mein pahunchi ali ki betiyan<br>
khaaq dale sar pe thi hum raha khatoon-e-jinha<br>
kya qayamat ka woh manzar tha mere maula hussain<br>
<br>
9. alam-e-arwah mein tha haq se jo wada kiya<br>
karbala mein aake tune is tarha pura kiya<br>
sar kataya deen ki khatar aur kiya sajda hussain<br>
<br>
10. hain raza-o-hashmi ki arzoo maula yahi<br>
aap ke rouze mein aakar hum padhe nauha yahi<br>
ta abad karte rahenge aap par giriya hussain<br>
<br>
marhaba ya hussain be watan ya hussain<br>
khastatan ya hussain fatima ka noor-e-ain<br>
ya hussain ya hussain